        {
          "key": "PluginManager.constructor",
          "method": "METHOD",
          "path": "PluginManager.constructor",
          "title": "PluginManager.constructor(bus, game, player, blocks, conditions)",
          "group": "PluginManager",
          "description": "Собирает объект `api`, который каждый плагин получает в `install(api)`.\n\nСтруктура api:\n```\napi\n├── events\n│   ├── on(event, handler) → unsubscribe\n│   └── emit(event, payload)\n├── game\n│   ├── getPluginLayer() → HTMLElement\n│   ├── registerLayer(name, element) → cleanup\n│   ├── registerNodeType(type, handler)\n│   ├── show(name)\n│   ├── hide(name)\n│   └── isVisible(name) → boolean\n├── player\n│   ├── getPluginLayer() → HTMLElement\n│   ├── registerLayer(name, element) → cleanup\n│   ├── show(name)\n│   ├── hide(name)\n│   └── isVisible(name) → boolean\n├── blocks          → BlockManager\n├── conditions\n│   └── evaluate(condition, state) → boolean\n└── plugins         → Proxy\n    └── <name>.api  → публичный API плагина\n```",
          "since": null,
          "deprecated": null,
          "permissions": [],
          "params": {
            "header": [],
            "path": [],
            "query": [],
            "body": [],
            "param": [
              {
                "group": null,
                "type": "EventBus",
                "name": "bus",
                "optional": false,
                "description": ""
              },
              {
                "group": null,
                "type": "VN",
                "name": "game",
                "optional": false,
                "description": ""
              },
              {
                "group": null,
                "type": "Player",
                "name": "player",
                "optional": false,
                "description": ""
              },
              {
                "group": null,
                "type": "BlockManager",
                "name": "blocks",
                "optional": false,
                "description": ""
              },
              {
                "group": null,
                "type": "ConditionEvaluator",
                "name": "conditions",
                "optional": false,
                "description": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          "success": [],
          "error": [],
          "examples": [],
          "successExamples": [],
          "errorExamples": [],
          "source": {
            "file": "plugin-manager.js",
